    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d148-a4">

                <pb facs="0316" n="220" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg220"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 54.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Translation of an imperial decree published in the
                        Peking Gazette, September 28, 1898.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Let Jung Lu officiate in the grand council and let Yü Lu fill the appointment of
                    viceroy of the province of Chihli and also fill the position of the
                    superintendent of northern trade.</p>
                <p>Let all the northern forces remain under the control of Jung Lu, who will be
                    assisted by Yü Lu.</p>
            </div>
